meta {
  name: Get Enrollment metrics
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/enrollment
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get Enrollment & Recruitment Metrics
  
  Returns chart-ready metrics for the Enrollment & Recruitment dashboard tab. Each field in the response is either a `Dataset` (chart object) or a `LineData` (key-value list), ready for direct consumption by the frontend charting library.
  
  > **⚠️ WIP:** All fields currently return hardcoded placeholder data. Database queries have not been implemented yet.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response Types
  
  Every field conforms to one of two types defined in `types/dashboard.d.ts`:
  
  ### `Dataset`
  ```typescript
  {
    type: "bar" | "line" | "doughnut" | "pie",
    labels: object,       // array of axis labels (string[])
    datasets: object      // array of { label?: string, data: number[] }
  }
  ```
  
  ### `LineData`
  ```typescript
  Array<{ title: string, amount: number }>
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Success Response — `200 OK`
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Enrollment and Recruitment data found successfully",
    "data": {
      "c_applicationNumbers": Dataset,
      "c_genderDiversity": Dataset,
      "c_classAgeDistribution": Dataset,
      "c_acceptanceRate": LineData,
      "c_geographicalDistribution": LineData
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ### `c_applicationNumbers` — `Dataset` (line) ⚠️ Hardcoded
  
  Monthly application counts per programme.
  
  | Field    | Value                                                           |
  |----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------|
  | type     | `"line"`                                                        |
  | labels   | `["Jan", "Feb", ..., "Dec"]`                                    |
  | datasets | Two series: `"ASH"` and `"TACOTS"` — monthly application counts.|
  
  ### `c_genderDiversity` — `Dataset` (pie) ⚠️ Hardcoded
  
  Gender split across enrolled students.
  
  | Field    | Value                                    |
  |----------|------------------------------------------|
  | type     | `"pie"`                                   |
  | labels   | `["Female", "Male"]`                      |
  | datasets | Single unlabelled series with two values. |
  
  ### `c_classAgeDistribution` — `Dataset` (bar) ⚠️ Hardcoded
  
  Student count by class/education level.
  
  | Field    | Value                                                                     |
  |----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | type     | `"bar"`                                                                    |
  | labels   | `["Primary", "JSS1", "JSS2", "JSS3", "SS1", "SS2", "SS3"]`               |
  | datasets | Single series `"Students"` — count per class level.                        |
  
  ### `c_acceptanceRate` — `LineData` ⚠️ Hardcoded
  
  Acceptance rate percentage per programme.
  
  ```json
  [
    { "title": "ASH", "amount": 74 },
    { "title": "TACOTS", "amount": 74 },
    { "title": "Volunteer", "amount": 74 }
  ]
  ```
  
  ### `c_geographicalDistribution` — `LineData` ⚠️ Hardcoded
  
  Student count by state/region.
  
  ```json
  [
    { "title": "Enugu", "amount": 70 },
    { "title": "Ebonyi", "amount": 60 },
    { "title": "Anambra", "amount": 50 },
    { "title": "Abia", "amount": 40 },
    { "title": "Imo", "amount": 30 },
    { "title": "others", "amount": 20 }
  ]
  ```
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
